---
description: Full-file LLM editorial workflow for production MCQ and its paired Markdown.
globs:
  - "modules/quiz-app/src/main/resources/seed/mcq/**/*.json"
  - "cheatsheets/interview/**/*.md"
  - "docs/mcq-quality/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

Use `docs/mcq-quality/workflow.md` and `PROMPT_PLAN_INTERVIEW.md`. Give one LLM the
entire production JSON, paired Markdown, rules and comments. For any change, even one question, regenerate the entire JSON in one LLM task and
return one complete replacement, checked by that LLM. Never accumulate patches
or assemble fragments. Do not run MCQ generation/validation
scripts or gates. Record LLM_READY only with full coverage and no open material
issue. This is not independent acceptance. Protect other authors' changes.
